/* Base sheet for every client RmlUi document: <link type="text/rcss" href="flash.rcss"/>. RmlUi has no user-agent
   sheet, so what a browser would assume is spelled out here. Pair it with <link type="text/rcss" href="text.rcss"/>,
   which the host generates from FontBook metrics (.t14 .t14b .t16 ... : font-size and line-height in dp, "b" = bold),
   and always size in dp: the host scales dp by drawable_height/600, as Flash's stage is scaled.

   Flash colour tokens (RCSS has no variables):
     white      #ffffff   text, button fill, scroll thumb
     panel      #363636   panel and dialog fill, button text   (0x363636)
     hover      #ffdc85   hovered button / thumb / arrow       (0xFFDC85)
     track      #545454   scroll bar track                     (0x545454)
     field      #333333   text field fill, border #454545, text #b3b3b3
     tooltip    #9b9b9b   tooltip border; unusable item border #a75b5b on #4b3030
     title      #57ad62   dialog titles

   Flash vector shapes (cut-edge rects, menu backdrops) are drawn by the client's painters into retained textures:
     decorator: paint(NAME ARG ARG ...);
   NAME and the ARGs are space-separated tokens inside the parentheses (no commas, no quotes); colours are 0xRRGGBB (or
   #rrggbb) and `none` where a colour is optional. The decorator paints the element's border box, one texture pixel per
   drawable pixel. Built-in painters:
     paint(cut-rect FILL STROKE CUT [STROKE_WIDTH [OPACITY]])
                                                      corners cut by CUT dp, e.g. paint(cut-rect 0x363636 0xffffff 4 2);
                                                      the outline is inset by half STROKE_WIDTH so it stays inside the box;
                                                      OPACITY (0 to 1, default 1) fades the whole shape
     paint(rect FILL)                                 an antialiased rectangle, e.g. paint(rect 0x545454)
     paint(menu-backdrop)                             the options / guild menu backdrop; give the element height: 600dp
     paint(deca NAME [flip-x] [flip-y] [press] [hover] [grey])
                                                      the Deca UI art ui/deca/NAME.svg, stretched like its atlas slice;
                                                      deca.rcss wraps it in widget classes (.deca-popup, .deca-button ...) */

div,p,input,textarea,pulse-text{display:block}
body{font-family:"Myriad Pro";color:#fff;font-size:14dp;width:100%;height:100%}
.abs{position:absolute}

/* Flash TextButton: white fill, 4 dp corners, 0x363636 bold 16 text, gold on hover. Add .t16b for its line height. */
.button{box-sizing:border-box;background-color:#fff;border-radius:4dp;color:#363636;text-align:center;font-size:16dp;font-weight:bold}
.button:hover{background-color:#ffdc85}

/* Flash's Scrollbar: 16 dp wide, white arrows and thumb (gold on hover), 0x545454 track. */
scrollbarvertical{width:16dp}
scrollbarvertical slidertrack{width:16dp;background-color:#545454}
scrollbarvertical sliderbar{width:16dp;min-height:16dp;background-color:#fff;border-radius:4dp}
scrollbarvertical sliderbar:hover,scrollbarvertical sliderbar:active{background-color:#ffdc85}
scrollbarvertical sliderarrowdec{display:block;width:0;height:0;margin-bottom:5dp;border-left:8dp transparent;border-right:8dp transparent;border-bottom:12dp #fff}
scrollbarvertical sliderarrowinc{display:block;width:0;height:0;margin-top:5dp;border-left:8dp transparent;border-right:8dp transparent;border-top:12dp #fff}
scrollbarvertical sliderarrowdec:hover{border-bottom-color:#ffdc85}
scrollbarvertical sliderarrowinc:hover{border-top-color:#ffdc85}
